          </zone>
          <zone h='5220' id='1847' name='Title Ops Metrics' show-title='false' w='88063' x='500' y='11454'>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='24557' id='1867' type-v2='text' w='88063' x='500' y='16674'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontsize='10' underline='true'>Definitions</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#666666' fontsize='9'>Holdback Time:</run>
              <run fontcolor='#666666' fontsize='9'> The time until the order was sent to the vendor. (Time difference between received_at and sending_to_vendor_at)</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#666666' fontsize='9'>Estimated Prep Time: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#666666' fontsize='9'>The estimated time it takes the restaurant to prepare the food. The time estimation comes from a prediction model</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#666666' fontsize='9'>Food is Ready: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#666666' fontsize='9'>The time difference between accepted_by_vendor_at and prepared_at</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#666666' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='9'>Preparation Time</run>
              <run fontcolor='#666666' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='9'> : Time between the order was sent to vendor till the moment rider picked it up.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#666666' fontsize='9'>At Vendor Time: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#666666' fontsize='9'>The time difference between rider arrival at vendor and the rider picking up the food.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#666666' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='9'>Pick up Time: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#666666' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='9'>Time between food_is_ready_at and order is picked up by rider.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#666666' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='9'>Time to pick up cleaned</run>
              <run fontcolor='#666666' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='9'> : Time between food_is_ready_at and order is picked up by rider only for the cases where was no rider delay.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#666666' fontsize='9'>Stacking Rate: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#666666' fontsize='9'>Number of deliveries that share the bag with the current one at pick up.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#666666' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='9'>Intravendor Share</run>
              <run fontcolor='#666666' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='9'> - Share of the orders that were stacked within one vendor id.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#666666' fontsize='9'>Order Delay: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#666666' fontsize='9'>The time difference between actual delivery time and promised delivery time.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#666666' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='9'>Offline Rate: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#666666' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='9'>Percentage of the opening vendor schedule where vendor actually was offline.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#666666' fontsize='9'>Fail Rate: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#666666' fontsize='9'>If the the order_status is other than in ( ACCEPTED&apos;, &apos;DELIVERED&apos;, &apos;DELAYED&apos;, &apos;PICKED_UP&apos;) rate over the total orders</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#666666' fontsize='9'>Vendor Fail Rate: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#666666' fontsize='9'>Failed orders with Failure Owner: VENDOR rate over the total orders</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#666666' fontsize='9'>Vendor Delay: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#666666' fontsize='9'>The delayed actual pick up time compared to the original scheduled pickup time in seconds when this is attributable to the vendor over the successful orders</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#666666' fontsize='9'>Rider Delay: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#666666' fontsize='9'>The time difference between rider arrival at vendor and the original scheduled pickup</run>
              <run fontcolor='#666666' fontname='Roboto' fontsize='9'>Æ </run>
              <run fontcolor='#666666' fontsize='9'>time over the successful orders</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#666666' fontsize='9'>For more informations:</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='9'>Æ </run>
              <run fontcolor='#4996b2' fontsize='9' hyperlink='tabdoc:load-url url=&amp;quot;https://data.catalog.deliveryhero.net/table_detail/fulfillment-dwh-production/bigquery/curated_data_shared/orders&amp;quot;'>https://data.catalog.deliveryhero.net/table_detail/fulfillment-dwh-production/bigquery/curated_data_shared/orders</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <format attr='margin' value='8' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
      </zones>
